---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import SectionTitle from "../../components/SectionTitle.astro";
import { SITE } from "../../lib/site";

const updated = "August 2026";
---

<BaseLayout
  lang="en"
  title="Privacy policy | Destinos del Norte"
  description="Learn how Destinos del Norte protects and uses your personal information: what data we collect, how we use it and your rights."
  breadcrumbs={[{ name: "Privacy policy", path: "/en/politica-de-privacidad/" }]}
>
  <section class="mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-5 py-10 lg:px-8 lg:py-14">
    <div class="max-w-2xl">
      <span class="inline-flex rounded-full bg-terracota/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-terracota">
        Privacy
      </span>
      <h1 class="mt-4 font-display text-3xl font-bold leading-tight text-navy lg:text-[42px] lg:leading-tight">
        Privacy policy
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-body lg:text-base">
        At Destinos del Norte we take your privacy seriously. We explain clearly and simply what information we process, for what purpose and what your rights are. Last updated: {updated}.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto w-full max-w-3xl px-5 pb-4 lg:px-8">
    <div class="space-y-6">
      <div class="rounded-2xl bg-tarjeta p-6 shadow-card">
        <SectionTitle title="1. Data controller" />
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-body lg:text-base">
          Destinos del Norte is a tourism website dedicated to sharing destinations, guides and experiences of Salta, Jujuy and Tucumán. For any question about your data you can write to us at{" "}
          <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`} class="font-medium text-terracota underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-terracota-hover">
            {SITE.email}
          </a>
          .
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-2xl bg-tarjeta p-6 shadow-card">
        <SectionTitle title="2. What information we collect" />
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-body lg:text-base">
          We collect the minimum needed to provide you with the site's information:
        </p>
        <ul class="prose-norte mt-3 max-w-none">
          <li><strong>Data you send us voluntarily</strong>: for example, the email you enter in the newsletter form. This data is stored in a Google Sheet only we can access, to send you guides and news from the North if you give your consent.</li>
          <li><strong>Contact form inquiries</strong>: when you write to us, we store your **name, email and message** in a Google Sheet only to answer your inquiry. It is not used for commercial purposes.</li>
          <li><strong>Usage data</strong>: we use analytics tools (such as Google Analytics) that collect aggregated browsing data (pages visited, device, session time) without personally identifying each user.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-body lg:text-base">
          We do not request or store sensitive data or contact information beyond what is stated.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-2xl bg-tarjeta p-6 shadow-card">
        <SectionTitle title="3. How we use the information" />
        <ul class="prose-norte mt-4 max-w-none">
          <li>Answer inquiries and communicate with you if you write to us.</li>
          <li>Send guides and news from the North if you subscribe to the newsletter.</li>
          <li>Improve the experience and content of the site through aggregated usage data.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-body lg:text-base">
          We do not sell, rent or share your personal data with third parties for commercial purposes.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-2xl bg-tarjeta p-6 shadow-card">
        <SectionTitle title="4. Cookies and third-party technologies" />
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-body lg:text-base">
          Our site does not use its own tracking cookies. However, some pages include third-party content that may use its own cookies:
        </p>
        <ul class="prose-norte mt-3 max-w-none">
          <li><strong>Google Maps</strong>: each destination page embeds a map that may use Google cookies according to its own privacy policy.</li>
          <li><strong>Analytics</strong>: we use Google Analytics, which may set cookies to collect aggregated usage data. You can disable it through Google's tools or your browser settings.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-2xl bg-tarjeta p-6 shadow-card">
        <SectionTitle title="5. Third-party services" />
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-body lg:text-base">
          We use third-party services only when they add value to the content:
        </p>
        <ul class="prose-norte mt-3 max-w-none">
          <li><strong>Google Maps</strong> (maps embedded in destinations).</li>
          <li><strong>Google Fonts / local fonts</strong>: our fonts load locally, without sending data to third parties.</li>
          <li><strong>Google Analytics and Microsoft Clarity</strong> (aggregated usage analytics).</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-body lg:text-base">
          Each provider applies its own privacy policy. We recommend reviewing them to learn how they handle data.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-2xl bg-tarjeta p-6 shadow-card">
        <SectionTitle title="6. Your rights" />
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-body lg:text-base">
          In accordance with Argentina's Law 25.326 on Personal Data Protection (and, where applicable, the EU's GDPR), you have the right to:
        </p>
        <ul class="prose-norte mt-3 max-w-none">
          <li>Request <strong>access</strong> to your data.</li>
          <li>Request its <strong>rectification</strong> if it is inaccurate.</li>
          <li>Request its <strong>deletion</strong> when it is no longer needed.</li>
          <li>Revoke the consent given.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-body lg:text-base">
          To exercise any of these rights, write to us at{" "}
          <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`} class="font-medium text-terracota underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-terracota-hover">
            {SITE.email}
          </a>
          .
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-2xl bg-tarjeta p-6 shadow-card">
        <SectionTitle title="7. Contact and updates" />
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-body lg:text-base">
          This policy may be updated to reflect changes to the site or legislation. We will publish the current version on this page with its update date. For any questions, you can write to us at{" "}
          <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`} class="font-medium text-terracota underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-terracota-hover">
            {SITE.email}
          </a>
          .
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-5 py-10 lg:px-8 lg:py-14">
    <div class="rounded-2xl bg-navy px-6 py-10 text-center lg:px-10">
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-white lg:text-3xl">
        Do you have any questions?
      </h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-3 max-w-xl text-sm text-navy-secondary lg:text-base">
        Write to us and we'll help you resolve your questions about the site or your data.
      </p>
      <a
        href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}
        class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-terracota px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-button transition-colors duration-200 hover:bg-terracota-hover"
      >
        Contact us
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
